# Container-internal Caddy (listens on :80, HTTP only — TLS is terminated by the
# edge Caddy on CT 100). Serves the static SPA and proxies /komga/* to Komga,
# injecting X-API-Key server-side so the browser never sees the key.
{
	admin off
}

:80 {
	encode gzip zstd

	# API + thumbnails → Komga. handle_path strips the /komga prefix so
	# /komga/api/v1/x → /api/v1/x upstream. Mirrors the Vite dev proxy.
	handle_path /komga/* {
		reverse_proxy https://komga.p2lab.com {
			header_up Host komga.p2lab.com
			# Drop the edge basic-auth Authorization header — otherwise Komga
			# tries to authenticate it as a Komga user and 401s, ignoring the key.
			header_up -Authorization
			header_up X-API-Key {$KOMGA_API_KEY}
		}
	}

	# Static SPA with client-side-routing fallback to index.html
	handle {
		root * /srv
		try_files {path} /index.html
		file_server
	}
}
